<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post3957853452180022293..comments</id><updated>2016-09-21T13:36:13.249-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Sipsey Street Irregulars: Bad Ass of the Week - Patton</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='https://billstclair.com/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>Dutchman6</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09935420042995679958</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-0dD3DfcQ3v8/Ub55cPMr2YI/AAAAAAAAXDw/9jlWvTVN5nw/s220/vanderboeghsmuggler.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>9</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-406748735523826794</id><published>2016-09-13T13:39:48.761-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-13T13:39:48.761-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Not 100% sure but I believe Posse Comitatus does n...</title><content type='html'>Not 100% sure but I believe Posse Comitatus does not apply in the confines of Wash. D.C.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/406748735523826794'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/406748735523826794'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473791988761#c406748735523826794' title=''/><author><name>snuffy smiff</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15372590495699674235</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1849374600"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2016 at 1:39 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8403544722205317280</id><published>2016-09-13T10:31:45.123-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-13T10:31:45.123-05:00</updated><title type='text'>also check out &amp;quot;Army at Dawn&amp;quot;&#xa;Patton had...</title><content type='html'>also check out &amp;quot;Army at Dawn&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;Patton had the gestalt needed to win including at one point withholding reserve Shermans when he was not sure committing reserves was worth the risk of having *NO* reserves left *At All*&lt;br /&gt;that is the toughest call ever in war&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;woerm/thr</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/8403544722205317280'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/8403544722205317280'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473780705123#c8403544722205317280' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-734062671"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2016 at 10:31 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6073434991509296149</id><published>2016-09-13T08:37:56.958-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-13T08:37:56.958-05:00</updated><title type='text'>This choice of yours is really confusing being you...</title><content type='html'>This choice of yours is really confusing being your supposed to be a 3%er. As pointed out by others his role in using military forces to attack Americans on American soil disregarding the laws makes him a criminal as those who gave the orders. &lt;br /&gt;He wasn&amp;#39;t in the State National Guard during this role he was active duty army. &lt;br /&gt;Please explain</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/6073434991509296149'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/6073434991509296149'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473773876958#c6073434991509296149' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-345646450"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2016 at 8:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-9203278595739180430</id><published>2016-09-13T04:49:37.806-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-13T04:49:37.806-05:00</updated><title type='text'>In reference to the Bonus Army cleared out by usin...</title><content type='html'>In reference to the Bonus Army cleared out by using the military - so much for Posse Comitatus..</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/9203278595739180430'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/9203278595739180430'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473760177806#c9203278595739180430' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1464333804"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2016 at 4:49 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8728361286633698589</id><published>2016-09-13T00:30:07.407-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-13T00:30:07.407-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Patton was a martinet ... and a military genius.  ...</title><content type='html'>Patton was a martinet ... and a military genius.  There are two seminal books on the man: &amp;quot;War As I Knew It&amp;quot;, and &amp;quot;Patton: A Genius For War&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There are other books about Patton, and many references.  But these two give you a good understanding about the man, more than the commander.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The movie &amp;quot;Patton&amp;quot; is not a good portrayal (he had a high pitched voice, not congruent with George C. Scott rendition) but it is based on &amp;quot;War As I Knew It&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;He got a lot of men killed, and that was his accepted price for victory.   &amp;quot;Who Dares, Wins!&amp;quot; could have been his motto.  And yes, we would not have had such a clear cut victory in WWII without a Patton.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Patton never looked at the price; he focused on the desired outcome.   If you want a better motto than &amp;quot;Who Dares Wins&amp;quot;, you can consider &amp;quot;Whatever it takes ... any thing at all!&amp;quot; to have been Patton&amp;#39;s true goal.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/8728361286633698589'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/8728361286633698589'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473744607407#c8728361286633698589' title=''/><author><name>Jerry The Geek</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16181610016755426448</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='21' src='//3.bp.blogspot.com/-z9h58JLChWU/VxmDLt2ld0I/AAAAAAAACJc/1LrBYEaprKY_rn4i_aR3yT6sc1icZ8ZJACK4B/s1600-r/Picture%252520218.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-322262775"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 13, 2016 at 12:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1325364903683724114</id><published>2016-09-12T16:25:55.458-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T16:25:55.458-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Well, I know this is NOT politically correct, BUT ...</title><content type='html'>Well, I know this is NOT politically correct, BUT we would have lost WWII without him.&lt;br /&gt;I would want him on our side now.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/1325364903683724114'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/1325364903683724114'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473715555458#c1325364903683724114' title=''/><author><name>Not Me</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00481923363770242409</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh4.googleusercontent.com/-9j328JO_hpo/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAhg/-F3ZLcyO5cA/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1194123647"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 4:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-1850292713278934503</id><published>2016-09-12T12:31:33.522-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T12:31:33.522-05:00</updated><title type='text'>and it was Patton, Eisenhower, and MacArthur who b...</title><content type='html'>and it was Patton, Eisenhower, and MacArthur who burned down the Bonus Marchers camp.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bonus_Army#Army_intervention  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/1850292713278934503'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/1850292713278934503'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473701493522#c1850292713278934503' title=''/><author><name>Allen</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18113393195056382332</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1787141443"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 12:31 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-4650922080833108708</id><published>2016-09-12T10:11:03.082-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T10:11:03.082-05:00</updated><title type='text'>While he was undisputedly a tactical and strategic...</title><content type='html'>While he was undisputedly a tactical and strategic genius, I lost any respect I had for the man when I found out he was involved in the attack on former service members during the Bonus Army incident in 1932. The same goes for McArthur and Eisenhower. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bonus_Army</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/4650922080833108708'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/4650922080833108708'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473693063082#c4650922080833108708' title=''/><author><name>mjw-1982</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17266030258123568353</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2003394071"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 10:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-6933442931120329360</id><published>2016-09-12T07:51:21.487-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-12T07:51:21.487-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Asshat, not bad ass. Search &amp;quot;bonus army&amp;quot;...</title><content type='html'>Asshat, not bad ass. Search &amp;quot;bonus army&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;Screw him and Eisenhower and MacArthur.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Tom762 </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/6933442931120329360'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/3957853452180022293/comments/default/6933442931120329360'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html?showComment=1473684681487#c6933442931120329360' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/bad-ass-of-week-patton.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3957853452180022293' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/3957853452180022293' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-67989363"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2016 at 7:51 AM"/></entry></feed>